  "releaseNotes": "0.1.4 adds REST-only user permission inquiry helpers for fresh intersections of the client account's and a named user's view/publish rights, including batch checks. Requires a REST deployment supporting /api/v1/authorization/check and allowlisting the service account through permission-inquiry-users. Failed checks throw exceptions rather than returning a denial.",
